          <span class="font-mono text-[12px] transition-colors" :class="tab === 5 ? 'text-[#5a9100]' : ''">06</span>
          <span class="flex-1 text-[19px] font-medium tracking-tight sm:text-[22px]">Enquiries</span>
          <span class="text-[18px] transition-all" :class="tab === 5 ? 'translate-x-0 text-[#5a9100] opacity-100' : '-translate-x-2 opacity-0 group-hover:translate-x-0 group-hover:opacity-60'" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
          <template x-if="tab === 5 && counting"><span class="tabfill absolute bottom-[-1px] left-0 h-[2px] bg-[#76B900]" style="animation-duration: 4.5s"></span></template>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="relative h-[560px] overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-[#141F24] sm:h-[600px]" style="box-shadow: 0 40px 70px -35px rgba(15,23,42,.55);">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 100% 100%, rgba(118,185,0,.18) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
        <div x-show="tab === 0" x-transition.opacity.duration.300ms class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col">
          <div class="overflow-hidden"><img src="/assets/images/solutions/voice-appointment-booking.svg" alt="Take a Booking illustration" class="block w-full" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[26px]">Take a Booking End to End</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">The agent establishes what is needed and for whom, checks live availability against staff, room and equipment constraints, offers slots that actually exist, writes the appointment to your system, and confirms by SMS or email.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><div class="mb-4 space-y-1.5 text-[13px]"><p class="rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-white/85 w-fit max-w-[92%]">"I'd like a check-up for Tuesday morning."</p><p class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[92%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-[#76B900]/25 px-3.5 py-2 text-white">"I can offer 10:30 with Anna, or 11:30 with Dev."</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Live availability check</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Service and duration matching</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Writes to your system of record</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">SMS/email confirmation</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div x-show="tab === 1" x-transition.opacity.duration.300ms style="display:none" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col">
          <div class="overflow-hidden"><img src="/assets/images/solutions/voice-reschedule-cancel.svg" alt="Reschedule & Cancel illustration" class="block w-full" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[26px]">Reschedules, Cancellations and Waitlists</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">The traffic that fills most reception phones. The agent identifies the caller, moves or cancels the appointment, releases the slot, and offers it to anyone on the waitlist — so a cancellation becomes a refill rather than a gap.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><div class="mb-4 space-y-1.5 text-[13px]"><p class="rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-white/85 w-fit max-w-[92%]">"I need to move my Wednesday appointment."</p><p class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[92%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-[#76B900]/25 px-3.5 py-2 text-white">"Thursday at 11:00 is free. I have released your old slot."</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Caller identification</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Slot release and refill</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Waitlist offers</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Cancellation policy enforcement</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div x-show="tab === 2" x-transition.opacity.duration.300ms style="display:none" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col">
          <div class="overflow-hidden"><img src="/assets/images/solutions/voice-outbound.svg" alt="Reminders illustration" class="block w-full" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[26px]">Outbound Reminders That Reduce No-Shows</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">Reminder calls placed as real conversations rather than recordings, so the caller can confirm, move or cancel during the call. A no-show costs the whole slot; a reschedule costs nothing.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><div class="mb-4 space-y-1.5 text-[13px]"><p class="rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-white/85 w-fit max-w-[92%]">(Outbound) "Hi, this is Northside Clinic about tomorrow."</p><p class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[92%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-[#76B900]/25 px-3.5 py-2 text-white">"Shall I keep 10:30, or move it? I can do Thursday."</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Two-way rescheduling</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Confirmation capture</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Escalation on no answer</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Opt-out handling</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div x-show="tab === 3" x-transition.opacity.duration.300ms style="display:none" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col">
          <div class="overflow-hidden"><img src="/assets/images/solutions/voice-complex-availability.svg" alt="Complex Availability illustration" class="block w-full" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[26px]">Multi-Provider, Multi-Resource Booking</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">Clinics with several practitioners and shared rooms, workshops with limited bays, studios where the kit matters as much as the person. Zennly resolves the conflicts the agent would otherwise have to guess at.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><div class="mb-4 space-y-1.5 text-[13px]"><p class="rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-white/85 w-fit max-w-[92%]">"I need a double appointment on Thursday."</p><p class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[92%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-[#76B900]/25 px-3.5 py-2 text-white">"A double needs the senior clinician and Room 2 together. They are free from 12:00."</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Multi-provider matching</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Shared resource conflicts</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Buffer and turnaround time</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Automatic conflict resolution</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div x-show="tab === 4" x-transition.opacity.duration.300ms style="display:none" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col">
          <div class="overflow-hidden"><img src="/assets/images/solutions/voice-after-hours.svg" alt="After Hours illustration" class="block w-full" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[26px]">Out-of-Hours and Overflow Cover</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">Cover evenings, weekends and holidays without a rota, and absorb the overflow when every line is busy. Urgent calls route to the on-call person; everything else is booked or queued with a transcript waiting in the morning.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><div class="mb-4 space-y-1.5 text-[13px]"><p class="rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-white/85 w-fit max-w-[92%]">(Sunday, 9:04pm) "Is anyone there?"</p><p class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[92%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-[#76B900]/25 px-3.5 py-2 text-white">"The office is closed, but I can book you in right now."</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">24/7 coverage</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Overflow from busy lines</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">On-call escalation rules</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Morning transcripts and summaries</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div x-show="tab === 5" x-transition.opacity.duration.300ms style="display:none" class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col">
          <div class="overflow-hidden"><img src="/assets/images/solutions/voice-enquiries.svg" alt="Enquiries illustration" class="block w-full" width="640" height="360" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div>
          <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col p-6 sm:p-8">
            <h3 class="text-[22px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[26px]">Questions Before the Booking</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">Opening hours, parking, what a treatment involves, whether you take a particular insurer or payment method — answered from your own documents, so the caller gets to the booking instead of ringing off to check.</p>
            <div class="mt-auto pt-5"><div class="mb-4 space-y-1.5 text-[13px]"><p class="rounded-2xl rounded-bl-sm bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-white/85 w-fit max-w-[92%]">"Are you open on Saturday, and what does a cleaning cost?"</p><p class="ml-auto w-fit max-w-[92%] rounded-2xl rounded-br-sm bg-[#76B900]/25 px-3.5 py-2 text-white">"We are open until 1pm on Saturday. A cleaning is on our price list; shall I book one?"</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Grounded in your documents</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Pricing and policy answers</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Directions and hours</span><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 bg-white/5 px-3 py-1 text-[12.5px] text-white/80">Handoff when unsure</span></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============ SAME CALL, TWO OUTCOMES ============ #}
<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="va-two-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="mb-12 text-center" data-reveal>
      <span class="mb-4 block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]">The difference</span>
      <h2 id="va-two-heading" class="text-balance text-[32px] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[44px]">The same call, two outcomes.</h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-3 font-mono text-[12px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Sunday, 9:04pm</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2" data-reveal-stagger>
      <div class="rounded-[28px] border border-navy-100 bg-white p-7 sm:p-9">
        <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#6B7280]">Today</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-red-500"><i class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400"></i>Lost</span></div>
        <ol><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9CA3AF]">01</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#6B7280]">Caller rings. Four rings, then voicemail.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9CA3AF]">02</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#6B7280]">They do not leave a message. Most people don't.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9CA3AF]">03</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#6B7280]">They ring the next business on the list.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9CA3AF]">04</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#6B7280]">Monday morning: nothing to follow up, because nothing was recorded.</span></li></ol>
        <p class="mt-6 border-t border-navy-100 pt-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">The loss is invisible. A missed call leaves no trace in any report, which is why it rarely shows up as a problem worth fixing.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-navy-950 p-7 sm:p-9" style="box-shadow: 0 40px 60px -30px rgba(15,23,42,.5);">
        <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 100% 0%, rgba(118,185,0,.28) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="mb-6 flex items-center justify-between"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]">With a booking agent</span><span class="flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]"><i class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]"></i>Booked</span></div>
          <ol><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">01</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white/85">Answered on the first ring. The agent identifies itself.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">02</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white/85">The caller describes what they need, in their own words.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">03</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white/85">Live availability checked against staff, room and buffer rules.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">04</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white/85">Tuesday 10:30 booked, written to your system, SMS confirmation sent.</span></li><li class="grid grid-cols-[2.5rem_1fr] items-baseline gap-3 border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">05</span><span class="text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white/85">Monday morning: the appointment is simply on the calendar.</span></li></ol>
          <p class="mt-6 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">Same caller, same 9pm, same business. The booking exists because something answered and could see what was genuinely free.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============ WHAT HAPPENS ON A CALL ============ #}
<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-navy-950 px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24 lg:px-8 lg:py-28" aria-labelledby="va-steps-heading">
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 60% at 0% 0%, rgba(118,185,0,0.16) 0%, transparent 60%), radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 55% at 100% 100%, rgba(87,119,130,0.22) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[0.75fr_1.25fr] lg:gap-20">
    <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-28 lg:self-start" data-reveal>
      <span class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]"><span class="h-px w-8 bg-[#9bd600]"></span>The call</span>
      <h2 id="va-steps-heading" class="text-balance text-[34px] font-medium leading-[1.1] tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[46px]">The talking is the easy part.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-white/60">Steps three and five decide whether a voice agent works, and they are where most of them fail. Both depend on the system behind the voice, not the voice itself.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="border-b border-white/10" data-reveal>
      <li class="group relative grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] items-start gap-x-5 border-t border-white/10 py-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:py-8">
        <span class="text-[48px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-transparent transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-[#9bd600] sm:text-[72px]" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #76B900;">01</span>
        <div class="max-w-xl"><h3 class="text-[21px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[25px]">Answer</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/55 transition-colors group-hover:text-white/80">Picks up on the first ring, identifies itself as an assistant, and asks what the caller needs. No menu, no hold music, no &ldquo;press 1&rdquo;.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="group relative grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] items-start gap-x-5 border-t border-white/10 py-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:py-8">
        <span class="text-[48px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-transparent transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-[#9bd600] sm:text-[72px]" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #76B900;">02</span>
        <div class="max-w-xl"><h3 class="text-[21px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[25px]">Understand</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/55 transition-colors group-hover:text-white/80">Works out the service, the duration it implies, whether a specific person is requested, and whether this is a new or returning caller, handling interruptions and corrections the way real callers talk.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="group relative grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] items-start gap-x-5 border-t border-white/10 py-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:py-8">
        <span class="text-[48px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-transparent transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-[#9bd600] sm:text-[72px]" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #76B900;">03</span>
        <div class="max-w-xl"><h3 class="text-[21px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[25px]">Check real availability<span class="ml-3 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/20 px-2.5 py-0.5 align-middle font-mono text-[9.5px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]">Where most agents fail</span></h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/55 transition-colors group-hover:text-white/80">The agent asks the scheduling engine what is bookable and can only offer what comes back. Staff, room, equipment and buffer rules are resolved there, never inferred by the model.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="group relative grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] items-start gap-x-5 border-t border-white/10 py-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:py-8">
        <span class="text-[48px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-transparent transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-[#9bd600] sm:text-[72px]" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #76B900;">04</span>
        <div class="max-w-xl"><h3 class="text-[21px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[25px]">Offer and agree</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/55 transition-colors group-hover:text-white/80">Offers two or three genuine options rather than reading a list, takes the caller&rsquo;s choice, and collects only what the booking actually requires.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="group relative grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] items-start gap-x-5 border-t border-white/10 py-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:py-8">
        <span class="text-[48px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-transparent transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-[#9bd600] sm:text-[72px]" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #76B900;">05</span>
        <div class="max-w-xl"><h3 class="text-[21px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[25px]">Write it back<span class="ml-3 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/20 px-2.5 py-0.5 align-middle font-mono text-[9.5px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]">Where most agents fail</span></h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/55 transition-colors group-hover:text-white/80">Written to your system as a transactional booking against the same engine that quoted the slot, so two callers racing for the last appointment cannot both get it.</p></div>
      </li>
      <li class="group relative grid grid-cols-[4rem_1fr] items-start gap-x-5 border-t border-white/10 py-6 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-white/[0.03] sm:grid-cols-[6rem_1fr] sm:gap-x-8 sm:py-8">
        <span class="text-[48px] font-semibold leading-none tracking-tight text-transparent transition-all duration-300 group-hover:text-[#9bd600] sm:text-[72px]" style="-webkit-text-stroke: 1.5px #76B900;">06</span>
        <div class="max-w-xl"><h3 class="text-[21px] font-medium leading-snug tracking-tight text-white sm:text-[25px]">Confirm and follow up</h3><p class="mt-2 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/55 transition-colors group-hover:text-white/80">Confirmation by SMS or email with a link to change it, then a two-way reminder call before the appointment so the caller can move it rather than not turn up.</p></div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============ AVAILABILITY ============ #}
<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="va-avail-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-20">
    <div data-reveal>
      <span class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]"><span class="h-px w-8 bg-[#5a9100]"></span>Why it works</span>
      <h2 id="va-avail-heading" class="text-balance text-[32px] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[44px]">Availability a plain calendar cannot represent.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-xl text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#374151]">Most booking automation assumes a calendar with free and busy time. Real constraints rarely look like that: two practitioners sharing one treatment room, a twenty-minute turnaround between slots, a double appointment that needs a senior clinician, a weekend slot that needs a deposit first. A tool that only sees free/busy will cheerfully offer a slot that cannot be honoured.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-[16.5px] leading-relaxed text-[#374151]">We run booking agents on <a href="/resources/zenly-case-study/" class="font-medium text-[#5a9100] underline underline-offset-2">Zennly</a>, our own scheduling engine, built for exactly this multi-provider, multi-resource case with automatic conflict resolution. The voice agent is the phone front end; Zennly is the part that knows what is genuinely bookable. If your existing calendar already expresses your rules, we will say so and connect straight to it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" data-reveal>
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-navy-100 bg-white p-5"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Free / busy only</p><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-[repeat(2,1fr)] gap-1.5"><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-slate-100"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-white"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-white"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-slate-100"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-white"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-white"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-amber-300"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-white"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-white"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded border border-navy-100 bg-white"></i></div><p class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-red-600"><i class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-red-400"></i>Offers 10:30 although Room 2 is taken</p></div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl bg-navy-950 p-5"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 100% 100%, rgba(118,185,0,.28) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div><div class="relative"><p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]">Resolved by the engine</p><div class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-[repeat(2,1fr)] gap-1.5"><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/10"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/5"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/5"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/10"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/5"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/5"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/10"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-[#76B900]"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/5"></i><i class="block h-6 rounded bg-white/5"></i></div><p class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12.5px] text-[#9bd600]"><i class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#76B900]"></i>Offers the first slot that is truly bookable</p></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{# ============ ALTERNATIVES ============ #}
<section class="px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20 lg:px-8 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="va-alt-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
    <div class="mb-14 max-w-3xl" data-reveal>
      <span class="mb-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#5a9100]"><span class="h-px w-8 bg-[#5a9100]"></span>Alternatives</span>
      <h2 id="va-alt-heading" class="text-balance text-[32px] font-medium leading-[1.12] tracking-tight text-[#111827] sm:text-[42px]">Voice agent, IVR, or answering service?</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">All three answer the phone. They differ in what happens next, and a voice agent is not always the right one.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 md:items-stretch" data-reveal>
      <div class="py-2 md:py-8 md:pr-8"><div class="relative"><h3 class="text-[24px] font-medium tracking-tight text-[#111827]">IVR menu</h3><p class="mt-1 mb-5 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#6B7280]">A menu that routes calls.</p><dl><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Caller experience</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Navigates a menu</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Completes the booking</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Rarely: routes or takes a message</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Knows real availability</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">No</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Out of hours</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Message only</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Twenty calls at once</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Yes</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Judgement on an odd case</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">None</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Best when</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">You only need routing</dd></div></dl></div></div>
      <div class="py-2 md:border-l md:border-navy-100 md:px-8 md:py-8"><div class="relative"><h3 class="text-[24px] font-medium tracking-tight text-[#111827]">Answering service</h3><p class="mt-1 mb-5 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#6B7280]">A person who takes the call.</p><dl><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Caller experience</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Speaks to a person</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Completes the booking</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Sometimes: often a message</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Knows real availability</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Only if given access</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Out of hours</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Costs more overnight</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Twenty calls at once</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">No</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Judgement on an odd case</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Good</dd></div><div class="border-t border-navy-100 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9CA3AF]">Best when</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-[#111827]">Calls are few, complex, high value</dd></div></dl></div></div>
      <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] bg-navy-950 p-8 md:-my-5 md:p-10"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true" style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 100% 0%, rgba(118,185,0,.28) 0%, transparent 60%);"></div><div class="relative"><span class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-[#76B900]/20 px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]">What we build</span><h3 class="text-[24px] font-medium tracking-tight text-white">Voice agent</h3><p class="mt-1 mb-5 text-[14px] leading-snug text-[#9bd600]">Answers, books and follows up.</p><dl><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Caller experience</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white">Speaks naturally</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Completes the booking</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white">Yes, written to your system</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Knows real availability</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white">Yes, from the scheduling engine</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Out of hours</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white">Same as any other hour</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Twenty calls at once</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white">Yes</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Judgement on an odd case</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white">Escalates to a person</dd></div><div class="border-t border-white/10 py-3.5"><dt class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-white/40">Best when</dt><dd class="mt-1 text-[15.5px] leading-snug text-white">Calls are many, repetitive, bookable</dd></div></dl></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-12 max-w-3xl text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">If your phone rings a handful of times a day with complex, high-value enquiries, a good receptionist beats any agent and we will tell you so. The case for a voice agent is volume and repetition.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="px-4 pb-16 sm:px-6 sm:pb-20 lg:px-8"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl"><div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
