    <p class="mt-5 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]">See <a href="/resources/dental-ai-case-study/" class="text-[#5a9100] underline underline-offset-2">Dental AI</a> and <a href="/resources/khems-cleaning-case-study/" class="text-[#5a9100] underline underline-offset-2">Khems Cleaning</a> (70% increase in bookings after we rebuilt how enquiries were captured).</p>
