      <span class="mb-5 block font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-[#9bd600]">What we need from you</span>
      <ol class="space-y-4">
        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">01</span><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/80"><strong class="font-medium text-white">20 to 30 real call recordings.</strong> They show your vocabulary and what callers actually ask.</p></li>
        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">02</span><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/80"><strong class="font-medium text-white">Your booking rules, written down.</strong> Durations, who does what, shared rooms, buffers, deposits.</p></li>
