        <li class="flex gap-4"><span class="font-mono text-[12px] text-[#9bd600]">04</span><p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-white/80"><strong class="font-medium text-white">A number and an escalation path.</strong> Who picks up when the agent hands over.</p></li>
